MIT License Notice

The current runtime core in this folder is based on the Readest
`packages/foliate-js` snapshot recorded in `PATCHES.md`, whose upstream
project is foliate-js by John Factotum (<https://github.com/johnfactotum/foliate-js>).
Historical Bookdock/ANX-derived notices are retained below for files that
originated from those sources; ANX is not a parallel runtime core.

The files include changes from the readest/foliate-js fork
(<https://github.com/readest/foliate-js>) and historical changes from the
anx-reader project (<https://github.com/Anxcye/anx-reader>).

foliate-js, readest/foliate-js and the anx-reader foliate-js fork are MIT licensed:
  https://github.com/johnfactotum/foliate-js/blob/main/LICENSE
  https://github.com/readest/foliate-js/blob/main/LICENSE
  https://github.com/Anxcye/anx-reader/blob/main/LICENSE

This subset was copied into bookdock solely for EPUB rendering via the
foliate-js engine. The original license terms are retained.

